@startuml sequence-game
' Sequence diagram: playing one round of blackjack.
' Render at https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml or with the VS Code PlantUML extension.
title Blackjack: Playing a Round

actor Player
participant "App" as App
participant "API" as API
database "MongoDB" as DB

Player -> App : Start game
App -> API : POST /api/game/start\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
API -> DB : Create game, deal cards
API --> App : Player's cards, dealer's up card

loop while round is active and player chooses hit
  Player -> App : Hit
  App -> API : POST /api/game/hit\n{ gameId } + bearer JWT
  API -> DB : Save updated game (version checked)
  API --> App : New card
end

alt round still active and player stands
  Player -> App : Stand
  App -> API : POST /api/game/stand\n{ gameId } + bearer JWT
  API -> API : Dealer plays, score round\n(win 3, tie 1, loss 0)
  API -> DB : Save result (version checked)
  API --> App : Outcome and points
else round already ended by natural blackjack or bust
  App -> App : Display outcome from start/hit response
end

note over API, DB : On round 10, save the completed attempt once\nusing the session ID before returning the response.

note over Player, DB : Repeat for 10 rounds. The final score goes to the leaderboard.
@enduml
